    {
      "id": "vocabulary-instructions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "How to read this plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 3520,
        "y": -760
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "vocabulary-declaration"
        },
        "markdown": "# How to read this plan\n\n- The five numbered **phases** run left to right and are done in that order. Each holds the **actions** beneath it.\n- The **decisions** along the top are made. The three in the right-hand column are still open.\n- **The wording is approved** is the gate before canon and the app change anything.\n- **Constraints** are how the work is done. The **risk** has its **contingency** beside it.\n\nStatus is kept in `plans/vocabulary/build.cjs`, in the `statuses` list. Change it there and run `node plans/vocabulary/build.cjs`."
      }
    },
