        "title": "Should the Declaration read as the graph’s root?",
        "description": "Michael’s idea: a reader might understand the Declaration better as the graph’s root. Only the word a reader sees would change, not the system.",
        "status": "draft",
        "notes": "",
        "definitionKey": "plan-decision",
